{"4625800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Black Plague: Survival", "steam_appid": 4625800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1347.<br>Europe is drowning in blood and fever. The Black Death doesn’t just kill—it brings the fallen back as eternally hungry zombies. Kings have abandoned their castles, and knights have fallen. But where the old order collapsed, a new one will rise.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/2403912845d808f7e16be64374294cd9.poster.avif?t=1781462515\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/2403912845d808f7e16be64374294cd9.webm?t=1781462515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/2403912845d808f7e16be64374294cd9.mp4?t=1781462515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Refugee to Knight and Clan Leader</strong><br>Your story begins in the mud and ash, but it doesn't have to end there.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Knight’s Path:</strong> Develop your character through a deep skill system. Become a master of the blade, a genius builder, or an alchemist who has tamed fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Founding a Clan:</strong> You are a leader. Gather friends under your banner (up to 4-player co-op) and create a force to be reckoned with by both the living and the dead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Code:</strong> In a world where faith is powerless, gunpowder is your new law, and the safety of your settlement is your honor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/11b1a10d8475ce08269496d7153664ea.poster.avif?t=1781462515\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/11b1a10d8475ce08269496d7153664ea.webm?t=1781462515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/11b1a10d8475ce08269496d7153664ea.mp4?t=1781462515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Citadel Amidst Madness</strong><br>Your settlement is the heart of your future Order.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Defend:</strong> Erect walls, fortify bastions, and set traps. Turn a fragile shelter into an impregnable fortress capable of withstanding endless zombie hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources and Crafting:</strong> Mine metal, wood, and rare ingredients. Craft everything needed for life and war—from armor to gunpowder bombs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Evolution of War: Devil's Mushrooms</strong><br>When steel breaks against monster flesh, gunpowder comes to the rescue.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sound of Progress:</strong> Use alchemy to create the first muskets and hand cannons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purifying Flame:</strong> Burn the infected with powder charges and grenades. In an age of chaos, he who owns the explosion technology owns the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/9669958bf0a007a9b7f42be01eabc8c7.poster.avif?t=1781462515\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/9669958bf0a007a9b7f42be01eabc8c7.webm?t=1781462515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/9669958bf0a007a9b7f42be01eabc8c7.mp4?t=1781462515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-op Survival:</strong> Fight side-by-side, share resources, and build a shared citadel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and Hierarchy:</strong> Rise from a wanderer to a clan leader, unlocking unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Building:</strong> Free-form construction and strategic base defense in a Top-Down format.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval Firearms:</strong> A unique blend of swords and early gunpowder weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Hordes:</strong> The infected change based on the time of day, forcing you to adapt your tactics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/e63a0f95d9a6d1ae744e01ad93b653aa.poster.avif?t=1781462515\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/e63a0f95d9a6d1ae744e01ad93b653aa.webm?t=1781462515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/e63a0f95d9a6d1ae744e01ad93b653aa.mp4?t=1781462515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1347.<br>Europe is drowning in blood and fever. The Black Death doesn’t just kill—it brings the fallen back as eternally hungry zombies. Kings have abandoned their castles, and knights have fallen. But where the old order collapsed, a new one will rise.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video 