on and Hierarchy:</strong> Rise from a wanderer to a clan leader, unlocking unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Building:</strong> Free-form construction and strategic base defense in a Top-Down format.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval Firearms:</strong> A unique blend of swords and early gunpowder weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Hordes:</strong> The infected change based on the time of day, forcing you to adapt your tactics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/e63a0f95d9a6d1ae744e01ad93b653aa.poster.avif?t=1781462515\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/e63a0f95d9a6d1ae744e01ad93b653aa.webm?t=1781462515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/extras/e63a0f95d9a6d1ae744e01ad93b653aa.mp4?t=1781462515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You are an outcast who lost everything in the flames of the plague but gained the knowledge of &quot;Devil's Mushrooms.&quot; In Black Plague: Survival, you must rise from a lone refugee to a fierce knight and leader of your own survivor clan.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/507dd3846665bb0d0e862efa3ec17fc6c4219e2c/header.jpg?t=1781462515", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625800/4f43a387ae78346f14da03f042a79351